  "critique": {
    "axis": "aesthetics",
    "evidence": "Strong dark technical art direction, disciplined cyan/red palette, crisp cards, and a clear headline-to-metrics hierarchy. Desktop is polished, but tablet and especially mobile reduce labels, explanatory text, table content, and chart annotations to near-illegibility. The mobile ablation cards feel densely compressed, while the header exposes only a narrow, abruptly clipped navigation rail. The precision-recall plot also leaves excessive empty chart space, weakening visual balance.",
